<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czceh Komercni banka to cut reference rate.</title>
<headline>Czceh Komercni banka to cut reference rate.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest Czech commercial bank Komercni banka a.s. said on Wednesday it was cutting its key reference rate to 12.05 percent from 12.25 percent with effect from May 5.</p>
</text>
